---
import ConnectivityFigure from '../ConnectivityFigure.astro';
---
<ConnectivityFigure label="Customs quay and inspected cargo illustration">
<svg class="scene net" viewBox="0 0 600 440" role="img" aria-labelledby="routing-title routing-desc">
<title id="routing-title">Choose the customs quay, then inspect cargo and the return manifest</title>
<desc id="routing-desc">The direct loading route bypasses customs. On the inspected route a consignment moves through customs to the ship. Its return manifest passes customs on the way back. Two stamps record the outward and return checks, representing request and reply inspection.</desc>
<text class="label" x="24" y="30">CUSTOMS QUAY / OUTWARD & RETURN</text>
<path class="scene__sea-fill" d="M26 234 Q166 219 302 232 T576 236 V291 H26 Z"/>
<path class="scene__line scene__quiet" d="M30 263 Q78 257 115 263 T202 263 M351 278 Q400 271 442 278 T564 278"/>
<path class="scene__paper" d="M26 230 V201 H342 V230 Z"/>
<path class="scene__heavy" d="M38 232 V260 M94 232 V260 M155 232 V260 M215 232 V260 M280 232 V260 M334 232 V260"/>
<path class="scene__hull" d="M359 218 Q457 233 575 215 L549 254 Q450 275 382 248 Z"/>
<path class="scene__line" d="M373 229 Q451 244 564 225"/>
<path class="scene__paper" d="M483 212 V176 H525 V212 M490 176 V157 H514 V176"/>
<path class="scene__line" d="M489 188 H499 V198 H489 Z M506 188 H517 V198 H506 Z M518 157 V124"/>
<path class="scene__solid" d="M519 125 l26 7 -26 6 Z"/>
<path class="scene__crate" d="M394 211 V185 H425 V211 M429 211 V185 H460 V211"/>
<path class="scene__heavy" d="M60 198 V64 H458 M64 65 L156 108"/>
<path class="scene__line" d="M48 198 H78 M65 69 H451"/>
<path class="line direct dash" d="M88 94 H441 V174"/>
<text class="small direct" x="174" y="53">Direct loading · bypasses customs</text>
<path class="scene__paper" d="M218 201 V131 L269 108 L320 131 V201 Z"/>
<path class="scene__line" d="M228 143 H309 M230 156 H246 V175 H230 Z M291 156 H307 V175 H291 Z M256 201 V154 H282 V201"/>
<text class="label" x="232" y="133">CUSTOMS</text>
<path class="line chosen dash" d="M88 184 H446"/>
<g class="travel cargo-trolley"><path class="scene__solid" d="M-8 -4 H8 V4 H-8 Z"/><path class="scene__line" d="M0 0 V84 M0 84 L-15 99 M0 84 L15 99"/></g>
<g class="travel outbound"><path class="scene__crate" d="M-15 -25 H15 V0 H-15 Z"/><path class="scene__line" d="M-15 -25 L15 0 M15 -25 L-15 0"/><circle class="scene__solid" cx="-20" cy="5" r="3"/><circle class="scene__solid" cx="20" cy="5" r="3"/><path class="scene__line" d="M-23 1 H23"/></g>
<g class="reveal landed"><path class="scene__crate" d="M429 185 V159 H460 V185 Z"/><path class="scene__line" d="M429 159 L460 185 M460 159 L429 185"/></g>
<g class="travel inbound"><path class="scene__paper" d="M-12 -29 H12 V0 H-12 Z"/><path class="scene__line" d="M-7 -21 H7 M-7 -15 H7 M-7 -9 H4"/></g>
<text class="small" x="28" y="287">Cargo = request</text><text class="small" x="342" y="287">Return manifest = reply</text>
<g class="reveal checked-out"><path class="scene__line" d="M31 324 l8 10 17 -23"/><text x="68" y="330">Cargo inspected</text></g>
<g class="reveal checked-back"><path class="scene__line" d="M314 324 l8 10 17 -23"/><text x="351" y="330">Reply inspected</text></g>
<text class="scene__before" x="24" y="383">A customs house cannot inspect a bypassing load.</text>
<g class="scene__after"><text class="pending" x="24" y="383">Follow the consignment, then its return manifest…</text><text class="reveal complete" x="24" y="383">1 exchange completed · both directions inspected</text></g>
<text class="small" x="24" y="419">The chosen route and customs rules allow this exchange.</text>
</svg>
</ConnectivityFigure>
<style>
.chosen, .inbound { opacity:0; }
.outbound { offset-path:path("M88 184 H446"); }
.cargo-trolley { offset-path:path("M88 60 H446"); opacity:0; }
.inbound { offset-path:path("M446 199 H88"); }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .direct { opacity:.15; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .chosen { opacity:.4; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .cargo-trolley { animation: request-trip var(--nautical-story-duration) linear both; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .landed { animation: landed var(--nautical-story-duration) step-end both; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .outbound { animation: request-trip var(--nautical-story-duration) linear both; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .inbound { animation: reply-trip var(--nautical-story-duration) linear both; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .checked-out { animation: checked-out var(--nautical-story-duration) step-end both; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .checked-back { animation: checked-back var(--nautical-story-duration) step-end both; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .complete { animation: completed var(--nautical-story-duration) step-end both; }
:global(.cp[data-demonstrate='true']) .pending { animation: pending var(--nautical-story-duration) step-end both; }
@keyframes request-trip { 0% {offset-distance:0%;opacity:1;} 46% {offset-distance:100%;opacity:1;} 47%,100% {offset-distance:100%;opacity:0;} }
@keyframes landed { 0% {opacity:0;} 47%,100% {opacity:1;} }
@keyframes reply-trip { 0%,48% {offset-distance:0%;opacity:0;} 49% {offset-distance:0%;opacity:1;} 95%,100% {offset-distance:100%;opacity:1;} }
@keyframes checked-out { 0% {opacity:0;} 24%,100% {opacity:1;} }
@keyframes checked-back { 0% {opacity:0;} 73%,100% {opacity:1;} }
@keyframes completed { 0% {opacity:0;} 95%,100% {opacity:1;} }
@keyframes pending { 0% {opacity:1;} 95%,100% {opacity:0;} }
</style>
